      "side": 1,
      "message": "Waiting for the request timeout might stall the creation/restarting of a RIB table: \n- A peer\u0027s AdjRibsOut commit is slow\n- the writer thread is parked in awaitCommit() holding the writer monitor\n- the LocRib chain fails for an unrelated reason\n- RIBImpl.onFailure() takes the RIBImpl monitor and calls restart() \n- this blocks on the writer monitor until the peer\u0027s commit resolves.\nConsider whether a custom timeout wouldn\u0027t be a better fit here.",
      "revId": "6acb1b65abeff7df24274a5f632c069ec7205a1a",
